    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24370" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-nĭtĕo</span></b> ,
		2, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to shine among</i>, <i>shine
				forth</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">etiam si qua sidera internitebant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					5, 4, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quicquid lucis internitebat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					4, 3, 16</span></i>
			: internitentes gemmae,
			
			<i><span class="en">id. 3, 3,
				16</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. 37, 5, 17, § 65</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Curt. 4, 12, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 11, 21</span></i>.</div>
